{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55113","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占虚实，後六作天空。\n若在干支虚事定，天空爲煞最朦胧，虚妄祸（辛本、川本作「更」、京本作「更望更」）重重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}